1/28/95

Directory of "Mail:jammail/text/":

    - Banner

        - Shown to the user when they initially contact my JamMail.

    - BbsError

        - Shown in the event an error occurs in JamMail, while the user is
          waiting at one of JamMail's prompts.

    - FileList

        - This is the "FR_FILES" listing, renamed. Users can type FILES
          from one of the JamMail prompts and be shown this file.

    - FReqBanner

        - File is shown to the user if they type FREQ from the main JamMail
          prompt.

    - FReqHelp

        - If the user types ? or HELP from the FREQ prompt in JamMail, then
          this file is shown to them.

    - Goodbye

        - If the user calls to FREQ files, but doesn't actually launch one
          of the bbs's, then this file is shown when they type Q or BYE.

    - Help

        - Shown if the user types ? or HELP from the main JamMail prompt.

    - Magic

        - Shown is the user types MAGIC from the main JamMail prompt.

    - UserFreq

        - Shown to the user when within the FREQ menu.

